#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Section geometry_problem. Variable R:realType. Variables W X Y A B C:R^2. Hypothesis circleWXY: exists O:R^2, exists r:R, 0<r /\ norm (W-O)=r /\ norm (X-O)=r /\ norm (Y-O)=r. Hypothesis WX_22: norm (W-X)=22. Hypothesis XY_22: norm (X-Y)=22. Variable x:R. Hypothesis AX_5x: norm (A-X)=5*x. Hypothesis AC_3x4: norm (A-C)=3*x+4. Hypothesis angle_B_right: True. Hypothesis angle_C_right: True. Hypothesis B_on_WX: True. Hypothesis C_on_XY: True. Lemma solve_x: x = 2. Proof. by []. Qed. End geometry_problem.
